      "writtenOn": "2024-12-17T20:16:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I added a mentioned of the macros here. AFAICT, the values are completely cast in stone. Every tutorial you find on the web says that in Java MAX_PRIORITY is 10. I\u0027m not entirely sure where it came from. Part of the issue may be that the class change rules would require all clients to be recompiled if it ever changed. And you kind of need to know what the range is in order to set intermediate priorities.",
